'Coverage data is transcribed from the user-provided ':'保障资料转录自用户提供的文件：',' (18 pages) and ':'（18 页）及',' (7 pages). Figures are source-reported, not independently checked against current insurer schedules. Benefits are subject to policy version, exclusions, eligibility, riders, panel rules and claim approvals. Need ratings are educational heuristics, not medical advice.':'（7 页）。数字来自该等资料，尚未与保险公司最新保障表独立核对。实际保障须视乎保单版本、除外责任、资格、附加险、指定医疗网络及理赔批准。需求等级仅供教育参考，并非医疗建议。','The score is a heuristic based on source-reported benefit breadth. It cannot predict actual claim approval.':'此评分根据来源资料所列保障范围作启发式估算，不能预测实际理赔结果。',
