'Indication not identified':'未能识别药物适应症','Ask your clinician or pharmacist about its indication':'请向您的医生或药剂师确认此药物的适应症','Select your current policy to see matching terms.':'请选择您目前的保单，以查看对应条款。','You indicated you do not take regular medication.':'您表示没有定期服药。','You take regular medication, but medicine names were not entered. You can add them in Profile.':'您表示有定期服药，但尚未填写药物名称。您可以在个人资料中补充。','Cancer drugs: check the MOH Cancer Drug List, approved indication and any rider. Routine prescriptions are a separate benefit.':'癌症药物须核对卫生部癌症药物清单、获批适应症及附加险。常规处方药属于另一类保障。','Routine long-term prescriptions for chronic conditions are not automatically reimbursed by an Integrated Shield Plan. Distinguish MediSave CDMP usage from MediShield Life insurance claims.':'综合健保计划不会自动报销慢性疾病的长期常规处方药。请区分 MediSave 慢性疾病管理计划用途与 MediShield Life 保险理赔。','For ongoing chronic-care visits, check whether the benefit concerns only care related to hospitalisation; CDMP/MediSave and clinic subsidies are separate funding mechanisms.':'持续慢性病门诊须区分是否仅保障与住院有关的治疗；CDMP／MediSave 及诊所补贴属于不同的资助渠道。','With a cardiac history, emergency transport and A&E treatment without admission are especially important to verify separately.':'如有心脏病史，须特别区分紧急转运及未住院的急诊治疗是否受保障。','Your specialist appointments may be covered only within the specified pre/post-hospitalisation window and provider network.':'您的专科复诊可能仅在指定的住院前／出院后期限及医疗网络内受保障。','See source documentation for specific details.':'具体内容请参阅来源文件。','Pre-existing-condition underwriting and exclusions':'既往病症核保及除外责任','Personal riders and claim-specific approval':'个人附加险及个别理赔批准','Current insurer policy-version confirmation':'保险公司现行保单版本确认','Read-aloud is not supported in this browser.':'此浏览器不支持语音朗读。','Voice input is available. Speak, review the transcript, then press Send.':'语音输入已就绪。请说出问题，检查转写内容后再按发送。','Your browser may not support speech recognition. Try Chrome, or type your question. Read-aloud remains available where supported.':'您的浏览器可能不支持语音识别。请尝试 Chrome 或直接输入问题；如设备支持，仍可使用朗读功能。','Read-aloud is not supported in this browser.':'此浏览器不支持语音朗读。','Voice input stopped.':'语音输入已停止。','Audio stopped.':'已停止播放。','New chatbot replies will be read aloud.':'新的聊天回复将自动朗读。','Automatic read-aloud is off. You can use Read aloud on any reply.':'自动朗读已关闭。您仍可点击任何回复旁的“朗读”。','Voice input stopped because you left the chatbot.':'您离开聊天页面，语音输入已停止。',
